name: ᝯㄝₓ Core
metadata:
  description: "Shared code for the ᝯㄝₓ plugins, plus a few features that belong to none of them. Every other ᝯㄝₓ plugin depends on it, so Stash installs it with them.\n\nIts settings are three buttons. General Globals... holds the options that reach every plugin or Stash's own pages: a louder Scene Tagger duration warning, right-click Paste in the Tags, Performers and Groups boxes, links opening in the same tab, counts on headings such as Tags (12), case-sensitive matching, the ⓕ and 🖬 card counters, and how many log lines a dialog keeps. Undo History Settings... sets how much history is kept. Dev Mods... holds switches for working on the plugins; none of them writes anything.\n\nUndo History keeps what the ᝯㄝₓ plugins write, and what you save on Stash's own pages, in this browser, so it can be undone later from Settings - Tasks or the ↶ button in the top bar. A change is undone only while its field still holds what was written, so a later edit is never overwritten. Back Up and Export saves the history with a database backup. Edits from another browser, Stash's own tasks or scripts are not recorded, and a deleted entity comes back under a new id.\n\nNothing else here writes to your library.\n\nRequires Stash 0.31.0 or newer."
